10" end="01:16.040">, </span><span begin="01:16.040" end="01:16.820">and </span><span begin="01:16.820" end="01:17.210">all </span><span begin="01:17.210" end="01:17.810">I </span><span begin="01:17.810" end="01:18.530">taught </span><span begin="01:18.530" end="01:18.830">her </span><span begin="01:18.830" end="01:20.630">was </span><span begin="01:20.630" end="01:23.060">everything</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.790" end="01:36.470"><span begin="01:25.790" end="01:28.580">Ooh</span><span begin="01:28.580" end="01:28.610">, </span><span begin="01:28.610" end="01:29.240">I </span><span begin="01:29.240" end="01:29.600">know </span><span begin="01:29.600" end="01:30.410">she </span><span begin="01:30.410" end="01:31.070">gave </span><span begin="01:31.070" end="01:31.490">me </span><span begin="01:31.490" end="01:33.170">all </span><span begin="01:33.170" end="01:33.560">that </span><span begin="01:33.560" end="01:35.180">she </span><span begin="01:35.180" end="01:36.470">wore</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.810" end="01:44.660"><span begin="01:38.810" end="01:39.020">And </span><span begin="01:39.020" end="01:39.500">now </span><span begin="01:39.500" end="01:39.890">my </span><span begin="01:39.890" end="01:40.520">bitter </span><span begin="01:40.520" end="01:42.050">hands </span><span begin="01:42.050" end="01:42.770">chafe </span><span begin="01:42.770" end="01:43.520">beneath </span><span begin="01:43.520" end="01:43.640">the </span><span begin="01:43.640" end="01:44.660">clouds</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.050" end="01:48.500"><span begin="01:45.050" end="01:45.530">what </span><span begin="01:45.530" end="01:45.980">was </span><span begin="01:45.980" end="01:46.070">Of </span><span begin="01:46.070" end="01:48.410">everything</span><span begin="01:48.410" end="01:48.500">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.500" end="02:00.050"><span begin="01:48.500" end="01:49.070">Oh</span><span begin="01:49.070" end="01:49.070">, </spa